# Pairs with PendingEventuallyCompletes. A lost activation must be able to resume the pending protocol.
MODULE: RecoveryNeverResumes
TARGET: PendingEventuallyCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a crashed reclaim never becomes runnable again
PERTURBS: Recover

--- FIND
    /\ ready' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ ready' = FALSE
--- END
